sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant H as heat-api
    participant K as Keystone
    participant E as heat-engine
    participant N as nova-api
    U->>H: create stack (Bearer JWT)
    H->>K: create service grant<br/>(grantee = heat, project P, roles)
    K-->>H: grant_id
    Note over E: hours later: autoscaling fires
    E->>K: redeem grant (mTLS, heat-engine SVID)
    K->>K: roles = grant ∩ grantor's live roles on P
    K-->>E: JWT sub=user, act=heat-engine
    E->>N: POST /servers, Bearer JWT, target P
    N->>K: authz check (delegation bound to P)
    K-->>N: allowed
